  <regions type="content">
    <region left="20" top="64" width="1560" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="15" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;">Gate Driver Calculation  -  positive-only gate drive (V.L = 0 V)</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="110" width="1560" height="51" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Yellow cells are the inputs. The example values are those of the uploaded sheet (WG75N65MFW1, 18 V, 85 kHz) so the two can be compared; replace them with the switch and driver datasheet values. The driver dissipates only its share of the gate power - the</p>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">rest goes into the external and internal gate resistors.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="185" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">1  Transistor spec and circuitry value</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="220" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-ON gate resistor (external):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="220" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_on</e>
        <e type="operand">15</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="263" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-OFF gate resistor (external):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="263" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_off</e>
        <e type="operand">7.5</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="306" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch internal gate resistance (datasheet R.G):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="306" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_int</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="349" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">0 reproduces the uploaded sheet; the datasheet value moves part of the gate power from the driver and the external resistor into the switch.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="380" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch input capacitance C.iss:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="380" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">C.iss</e>
        <e type="operand">4307</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">pF</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="423" width="470" height="47" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch total gate charge Q.g at V.H [nC x 10^-9 A s]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="423" width="1080" height="47" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">Q.g</e>
        <e type="operand">210</e>
        <e type="operand">10</e>
        <e type="operand">9</e>
        <e type="operator" args="1">-</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">s</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="478" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Q.g must be read at the drive voltage V.H (gate charge curve), not at the datasheet test voltage.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="509" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switches driven per channel (paralleled):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="509" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">n.par</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="568" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">2  Switching and gate driver spec</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="603" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switching frequency:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="603" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">f.sw</e>
        <e type="operand">85</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">kHz</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="646" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-ON gate voltage V.H (driver supply):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="646" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.H</e>
        <e type="operand">18</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="689" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-OFF gate voltage V.L (unipolar drive):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="689" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.L</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="732" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">this sheet is for 0 V turn-off; V.H - V.L is the swing in every formula, so a negative V.L still computes, but then Q.g must be the charge over that swing.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="763" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Driver internal high-side FET R.on (source):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="763" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.on_H</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="806" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Driver internal low-side FET R.on (sink):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="806" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.on_L</e>
        <e type="operand">1.5</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="849" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Driver quiescent supply current I.Q:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="849" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.Q</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">mA</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="892" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">0 reproduces the uploaded sheet; take the datasheet I.Q (all supplies) at V.H.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="923" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Driven channels in the package (2 for a half-bridge driver):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="923" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">N.ch</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="966" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Driver thermal resistance junction-ambient [C/W]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="966" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.th_JA</e>
        <e type="operand">120</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1009" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Driver maximum junction temperature [C]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1009" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">T.j_max</e>
        <e type="operand">125</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1184" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">3  Gate timing and peak current</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1219" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Gate swing:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1219" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="1">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.sw</e>
        <e type="operand">V.H</e>
        <e type="operand">V.L</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">18.0</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1262" width="470" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Equivalent gate capacitance from the charge, Q.g / swing:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1262" width="1080" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="2">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">C.eq</e>
        <e type="operand">n.par</e>
        <e type="operand">Q.g</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand">V.sw</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">nF</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">11.67</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1323" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">includes the Miller charge, so it is larger than C.iss and gives the real timing.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1354" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Gate rising time 10-90 %, 2.2 (R.on_H + R.g_on + R.g_int) C.iss:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1354" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="0">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">t.r_iss</e>
        <e type="operand">2.2</e>
        <e type="operand">R.on_H</e>
        <e type="operand">R.g_on</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
        <e type="operand">R.g_int</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
        <e type="bracket">(</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand">n.par</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand">C.iss</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">ns</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">152</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1397" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Gate falling time 90-10 %, 2.2 (R.on_L + R.g_off + R.g_int) C.iss:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1397" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="0">
      <input>
        <e type="operand">t.f_iss</e>
        <e type="operand">2.2</e>
        <e type="operand">R.on_L</e>
        <e type="operand">R.g_off</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
        <e type="operand">R.g_int</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
        <e type="bracket">(</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand">n.par</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand">C.iss</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">ns</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">85</e>
        </result>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1440" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">- Gate rising time 10-90 %, with C.eq:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1440" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math decimalPlaces="0">
